hifiberry-shairport (5.0.0.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Updated to use HiFiBerry fork of Shairport Sync 5.0 (commit 1264fc67f7c8d2de2a386c235a0d29d1252010ce)
  * Added configurable version and commit ID support in debian/rules
  * Maintains dual AirPlay version support (AirPlay 1 and AirPlay 2 binaries)
  * Enhanced build system for easier version management
  * Added libplist-utils build dependency for AirPlay 2 support

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Fri, 11 Jul 2025 16:00:00 +0000

hifiberry-shairport (4.3.7.8) stable; urgency=medium

  * Added dual AirPlay version support - builds both AirPlay 1 and AirPlay 2 binaries
  * AirPlay 2 version installed as /usr/bin/shairport-airplay2
  * AirPlay 1 (legacy) version installed as /usr/bin/shairport
  * Added version configuration option in general section (version = "1" or "2")
  * Start script automatically selects correct binary based on version setting
  * Defaults to AirPlay 2 if no version specified for backwards compatibility

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Fri, 11 Jul 2025 15:00:00 +0000

hifiberry-shairport (4.3.7.7) stable; urgency=medium

  * Improved systemd service integration with debhelper compatibility
  * Added both shairport-sync.service and nqptp.service files for proper management
  * Updated postinst/prerm scripts for idempotent systemd handling
  * Enhanced upgrade detection and service state preservation
  * Documented all systemd integration improvements

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Fri, 11 Jul 2025 12:00:00 +0000

